# Local checkouts the build script resolves, and build output. Both repos are
# unreleased for this demo, and cargo honours `[patch]` only in the workspace
# root it builds, so the gateway names the policy-engine crates itself and needs
# the second checkout on disk. See build-gateway.sh.
/.praxis
/.policy
# ... and any hand-made backup of it, which is a git checkout too and would
# otherwise be staged as an embedded repository.
/.praxis.*
/.policy.*
/target
